U 架构上时，将类型提升为 `DT_FLOAT`。该修改补齐了 tensor/scalar 除法在 fp16/bf16 场景下的类型处理，与此前已存在的 double→float 降级逻辑（针对非 RegBase 架构，第 264–266 行）形成对称。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `MODE_TRUNC_DIV` 下 fp16/bf16 的类型提升规则**：在 `InferDivsModeDtype`（第 268–270 行）中，对 `DT_BF16` 或 `DT_FLOAT16` 且在 RegBase 架构上执行 `MODE_TRUNC_DIV` 时，强制将 `promoteType` 提升为 `DT_FLOAT`，解决该场景下 fp16/bf16 不被支持的问题。\n- **仅影响 tensor/scalar 路径**：此规则仅加入 `InferDivsModeDtype`（标量除法类型推导），未加入 `InferDivModeDtype`（张量/张量除法类型推导），符合 PR 标题所述\"tensor/scalar fp16/double 场景\"的修复范围。\n\n**审查结论**：该文件变更逻辑清晰、无代码缺陷，与现有代码风格一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-18T16:00:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:00:02+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176271225,"discussion_id":"a36777b70cf00e0dd7abb94b7af1402a64040dd4","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-18T16:02:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:02:51+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176283194,"discussion_id":"6b129ed730134e3587296ad7f38c8960e3e97c61","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-06-18T16:45:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-18T16:45:58+08:00","user":{"id":"68cd255bb557cf32e435d73c","login":"yefeicoding","object_id":"68cd255bb557cf32e435d73c","name":"yefeicoding","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fd/ba/fd4524558b85a3fa3012feda6b0948f80023d74f5b8fefee0fccf12823d33a2d.png?time=1778567897848","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yefeicoding"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":